WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.233
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Shakespeare at school</b>

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.350
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Forty boys on benches with their quills,

00:00:06.531 --> 00:00:09.323
Six days a week through almost all the year,

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.824
Long hours of Latin with relentless drills

00:00:12.824 --> 00:00:15.876
And repetition, all enforced by fear.

00:00:16.337 --> 00:00:18.851
I picture Shakespeare sitting near the back,

00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:21.219
Indulging in a risky bit of fun

00:00:21.278 --> 00:00:23.446
By exercising his prodigious knack

00:00:23.501 --> 00:00:25.650
Of thinking up an idiotic pun,

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:28.314
And whispering his gem to other boys,

00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:31.020
Some of whom could not suppress their mirth –

00:00:31.565 --> 00:00:33.677
Behaviour that unfailingly annoys

00:00:33.703 --> 00:00:35.686
Any teacher anywhere on earth.

00:00:36.397 --> 00:00:38.854
The fun was over when the master spoke:

00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:44.337
<i>Will Shakespeare, come up here and share the joke.</i>